      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PONY TAIL (2) has a strong record this trip with seven wins and six placings from 15 starts. Missed the frame latest (20.03) when eighth over 366m at Capalaba in a OPEN. Has the ability and should feature. BRING ON BLING (1) doesn't win out of turn. Hit the board with a minor placing last time when third (18.20) at this track. Expecting another good run. REALLY SAVAGE (3) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (18.65) in a Grade 4/5 at Richmond. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. His last run is a proven strong form reference. Shapes as one to consider. MUSCLE MEMORY (8) racing over this distance brings the best out in him.",
